                                                "sense_id": "e9790f90-f19e-30be-9a1d-caeba46178a4",
                                                "text": "The Darwinian movement has made no difference to mankind, except that, instead of talking unphilosophically about philosophy, they now talk unscientifically about science."
                                            }
